              "value": "The gold dragon breathes in one of two ways. The dragon can't use Breath Weapon again for 1d4 rounds.\n\n\u2022 Flame. The dragon breathes a blast of flame in a 50-foot cone that deals 20d6 fire damage (DC 44 basic Reflex save).\n\u2022 Weakening Gas. The dragon breathes a blast of weakening gas. Each creature within a 50-foot cone must succeed at a DC 44 Fortitude save or become enfeebled 3 for 1 minute (or enfeebled 4 on a critical failure)."
